Subject: [PATCH 2/2] macro-acid-ext-tg: generator, Sheep wavetable linked
 apart, one-command build script (not yet built for the Cycles)

Model-TG + MACRO + ACID without the five Syntakt engines, MACRO extended with Peaks and Sheep (SHAPE 47..53).
Existing MACRO tweaks keep their bytes: macro.cc changes are under MC_EXT, gen_macro.EXT defaults to False.
Notes 75 corrected: dropping all five engines frees ~152 KB; dropping one frees almost nothing.

